--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -27,3 +27,9 @@
 - `POST /api/todos` `{ title }`: adds one (400 without a title)
 - `PATCH /api/todos/:id` `{ title?, done? }`: changes one (404 if it doesn't exist)
 - `DELETE /api/todos/:id`: removes one (404 if it doesn't exist)
+
+
+## Local service test environment
+This fixture requires isolated PostgreSQL 16 and Redis 7, supplied via DATABASE_URL and REDIS_URL. No production services or secrets are required.
+Run npm ci, then npm run services:migrate, npm run services:seed, and npm run services:verify. Seeding before migration fails because the table does not exist. Migration and seed commands are idempotent.
+Use npm run test:services for real SQL/cache assertions. Start with PORT=3000 npm run dev; GET /api/service-health checks both services. The original file-backed /api/todos UI is unchanged; the new SQL API is /api/shared-todos and /api/shared-todos/stats, with PATCH /api/shared-todos/:id to change done.
